    "body": "Merged main (tip 21aac9ff); it merges cleanly now.\n- **Text conflict:** `fixture.rs` `named_boxes_for` now uses main's per-setup `table_box(world, declared)`.\n- **One shared law:** the core of #482's `fixture_struck::op_hits` is split into a world-free `fixture_struck::path_hits`. The post gate (`op_hits`), the generator's `workholding_warnings` and the route planner's re-judge all use it, so a routed link is judged exactly as the gate judges it: the same per-setup workholding, meshes, rotary axis and spindle (`machine::of_setup`).\n- **Z-stroke cap:** it reads the op's own setup's machine (#471), not the active one.\n- **New test:** `the_z_stroke_cap_reads_the_ops_own_setups_machine_not_the_active_one`.\n- **Gate:** fixture_route 7, fixtures 14, fixture_mesh 3, fixture_ux 9, setup_mounts_post 5, posting 17, golden_cl 23 and conformance 6 pass; clippy is clean.\n- **Still draft:** this changes posted G-code (raised G0 links), so it waits for a Hub or machine run.",
